*.json filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Keep the language bar honest: this repo's product is the Python gateway in
# dio-serve/. Without these rules GitHub labels the whole repository
# "BibTeX Style" because the LaTeX manuscript and its .bst sources outweigh the
# code, which makes it look like a paper dump rather than an installable tool.
*.tex linguist-documentation
*.bib linguist-documentation
*.bst linguist-vendored
*.cls linguist-vendored
*.sty linguist-vendored
*.bbl linguist-documentation
paper_drafts_latex/** linguist-documentation
figs/** linguist-documentation
tables.csv linguist-documentation
*.log linguist-vendored
Hetero_gpu_T4 linguist-vendored